103..179 Comment "/// `ua[1, 4]` written by hand: reflexivity at the unit for the empty shape,"
180..258 Comment "/// then one `equiv` per corolla in catalogue order, the constant\'s before the"
259..337 Comment "/// binary one\'s, nested to the right. What the hand definition does not state"
338..415 Comment "/// is what `ua` checks beyond it: naturality along each corolla\'s symmetries"
416..493 Comment "/// (`pathological/higher-cells/ua-by-hand-unnatural.gandr`), and from degree"
494..573 Comment "/// two (`ua-corolla-strata.gandr`) the Segal certification of the stages above"
574..591 Comment "/// the corollas."
592..595 Comment "///"
596..671 Comment "/// The directed twin is a flow: `stay` at the unit, then one `forward` per"
672..750 Comment "/// corolla, nested by `flowProduct` in the same order. A term ridden along it"
751..826 Comment "/// moves forward as it moves along the path: `rides` states it, as `moves`"
827..905 Comment "/// states the transport, and `ridden` runs it. The ride that would reverse it"
906..953 Comment "/// is refused, as every symmetry of a flow is."
